== Variations ==
=== Spikeball ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Spikeball
 | id          = 852
 | environment = {{floor|Corpse}}
 | behavior    = Spike balls that fly in a line either horizontally or vertically, bouncing off walls and obstacles.
}}

'''Spikeballs''' fly back and forth in a line either horizontally or vertically, bouncing off walls and obstacles. They will be destroyed once the room is cleared. However, if the room doesn't need clearing, they will remain permanently.

Spikeballs will be destroyed immediately upon entering a room while holding the {{t|Flat File}}.
{{clear}}

